📊 Differences at a Glance
| Feature    | **List**        | **Set**                         | **Map**                       |
| ---------- | --------------- | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Order      | Maintains order | No order (except LinkedHashSet) | Key-based, not index-based    |
| Duplicates | Allowed         | Not allowed                     | Keys not allowed to duplicate |
| Access     | By index        | By iterator                     | By key                        |


📌 Specialized Collections
| Collection        | Feature                                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------- |
| **ArrayList**     | Fast random access, slower inserts/removals |
| **LinkedList**    | Fast inserts/deletes, slower access         |
| **HashSet**       | No order, fast lookup                       |
| **TreeSet**       | Sorted order                                |
| **HashMap**       | Fast key-based access                       |
| **TreeMap**       | Sorted by keys                              |
| **PriorityQueue** | Elements sorted by priority                 |


